WEBVTT

26:01.709 --> 26:03.667
he believes his mom
doesn't want him to hit them.

26:03.750 --> 26:05.917
So he spares them
forever in his mom's name.

26:06.417 --> 26:08.084
He even made friends out of this.

26:09.250 --> 26:10.167
Hey!

26:10.709 --> 26:13.834
Thank you for sparing my grandpa.
